
# Privacy Policy for CaptionPro

**Effective Date:** June 8, 2026

CaptionPro (“we”, “our”, or “us”) operates the CaptionPro mobile application (the “App”). This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use our App.

---

## 1. Information We Collect

We do **not require users to create an account** to use CaptionPro.

However, we may collect the following types of information:

### a) Personal Information

We do **not directly collect personal information** such as name, email, or phone number unless you voluntarily contact us for support.

### b) Usage Data

We may collect non-personal data such as:

* Device type and model
* Operating system version
* App usage behavior (features used, time spent)
* Crash logs and performance data

### c) Advertising Data

Since CaptionPro is a free app supported by ads, advertising networks may collect:

* Device advertising ID
* Approximate location (non-precise)
* Ad interaction data

This is handled by third-party ad providers.

---

## 2. How We Use Information

We use collected data to:

* Improve app performance and user experience
* Fix bugs and crashes
* Display relevant advertisements
* Analyze usage trends

---

## 3. Ads and Third-Party Services

CaptionPro may show:

* Interstitial ads
* Rewarded video ads
* Banner ads

We use third-party advertising networks (such as Google AdMob or similar providers) that may collect data to serve personalized or non-personalized ads.

These third-party services have their own privacy policies, and we recommend reviewing them.

---

## 4. Data Storage and Security

We do not store personal user data on our servers.
We take reasonable measures to protect any data collected through third-party services.

However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure.

---

## 5. Children’s Privacy

CaptionPro is not intended for children under the age of 13.
We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.

---

## 6. Your Rights

Depending on your region, you may have rights to:

* Opt out of personalized ads
* Request deletion of data handled by third-party services
* Control device permissions

You can manage most of these settings through your device.

---

## 7. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted within the App or updated on this page with a new effective date.

---

## 8. Contact Us

If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at:

**Email:** [support@captionpro.app](mailto:support@captionpro.app) (replace with your real email)

